  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Qin Bai Sheng’s auction stretch, Heavenly Gong Immortal Gu resonates in his mind while he sits recovering from testing a fraction of its power, then he flies toward Crimson Reed Marsh.",
      "chapters": [
        747
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_heavenly_gong",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "loc_crimson_reed_marsh"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When that Gu goes up for trade, other Gu Immortals name him a famous demonic path loner of Northern Plains, say he was raised by a female wolf, and recall that Old Ancestor Xue Hu once tried to recruit him and was refused.",
      "chapters": [
        751
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "char_old_ancestor_xue_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He holds three immortal wolf transformation killer moves and seeks a water based fighting form, so he trades Heavenly Gong for grand smoke sea turtle shell Immortal Gu plus Ascending Heaven Plain intelligence after rejecting demon ferret skin and the aerial moon demon bat claw. The same auction talk places him as a rank seven lone cultivator who fights for resources himself and distrusts other Gu Immortals enough to leave gaps in his information.",
      "chapters": [
        751
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_ascending_heaven_plain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Outside the auction he ambushes as a giant wolf for a sandalwood sacred elephant egg, and Fairy Jiang Yu calls him a rank seven target Chanyu Zhong Er is naive to try recruiting.",
      "chapters": [
        764
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_jiang_yu",
        "char_chanyu_zhong_er"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He transforms into a giant wolf the size of a small hill. That wolf has an eerie gaze and speaks in a human voice.",
      "chapters": [
        764
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The huge wolf is menacing, with huge wolf eyes.",
      "chapters": [
        772
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "As a fragrant sorcerer yin statue wolf he is smaller than usual wolves, with no fur, like an oiled brown wooden statue that gives off an eerie aura. A mushroom-like bone grows on his head and resembles a black triangular hat. His eyes have no shiny pupils. Two lumps of green flame burn there.",
      "chapters": [
        876
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "As a lightning flash giant wolf he is as large as an elephant and covered in blue fur. The tips of that fur hold mysterious blue crystals that give off a weak spark.",
      "chapters": [
        877
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng immobilizes him with soul suppression and names him a demonic path Gu Immortal. His first spoken submission is a ruse; after a second crush of his huge wolf form Qin Bai Sheng gives a final submit-or-die ultimatum, and He Lang Zi turns silent. The killer move targets the soul so beast transformation alone cannot resist it.",
      "chapters": [
        772
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qin-bai-sheng-and-soul-suppression",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Shadow Sect abandons Lang Ya blessed land and returns to defend, he is listed among that defending side with Qin Bai Sheng, Fairy Jiang Yu, and Hui Feng Zi.",
      "chapters": [
        886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-defense",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_hui_feng_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Luo Po Valley he transforms into the lightning flash giant wolf under Hong Chi Ming’s pursuit, then that giant wolf form is cut in two; his corpse returns to human shape and he dies with torn organs. The aftermath list counts him among the dead after Qin Bai Sheng and Fairy Jiang Yu are sacrificed.",
      "chapters": [
        925
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley",
        "char_hong_chi_ming"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later names him to Lang Ya land spirit as a transformation path Gu Immortal with high battle strength who once rejected Old Ancestor Xue Hu’s recruitment.",
      "chapters": [
        979
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-to-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later comparison treats him as the example of a transformation path Gu Immortal who can turn into three types of wolves with different dao marks, but must wait and clear the prior marks before switching forms.",
      "chapters": [
        1041
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dao-mark-switching",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
